    {"page": 3, "start": 848, "end": 864, "top": 72.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 376.2, "baseline": 106.34, "inkLeft": 235.78, "text": "HELLO WORLD 123\u000d"},
    {"page": 3, "start": 864, "end": 964, "top": 114.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 502.8, "baseline": 124.85, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back past the "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 964, "end": 1062, "top": 127.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 498.0, "baseline": 138.29, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "lighthouse and the market stalls fold open their striped awnings. Gulls wheel over the quay while "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1062, "end": 1161, "top": 141.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 507.6, "baseline": 151.73, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "merchants argue cheerfully about the price of mackerel, and a baker carries warm loaves across the "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1161, "end": 1268, "top": 154.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 528.6, "baseline": 165.17, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "cobbles to the cafe on the corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and the narrow streets fill with the sound "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1268, "end": 1312, "top": 168.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 248.4, "baseline": 178.61, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "of voices, bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1312, "end": 1399, "top": 181.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 528.0, "baseline": 192.05, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "TYPESETTING DEPENDS ON SMALL DECISIONS REPEATED THOUSANDS OF TIMES: WHERE A LINE ENDS, "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1399, "end": 1481, "top": 194.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 526.2, "baseline": 205.27, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "HOW MUCH SPACE FOLLOWS A PARAGRAPH, AND WHICH WORDS TRAVEL TOGETHER ACROSS A PAGE "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1481, "end": 1565, "top": 208.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 520.2, "baseline": 218.71, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "BOUNDARY. A FAITHFUL REPRODUCTION MUST MAKE EXACTLY THE SAME DECISIONS, BECAUSE ONE "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1565, "end": 1651, "top": 221.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 519.6, "baseline": 232.15, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "DIFFERENT BREAK EARLY IN A DOCUMENT MOVES EVERY LINE THAT FOLLOWS IT ONTO A DIFFERENT "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1651, "end": 1657, "top": 235.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 98.4, "baseline": 245.59, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "PAGE.\u000d"},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1657, "end": 1748, "top": 248.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 525.0, "baseline": 259.99, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1748, "end": 1840, "top": 262.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 533.4, "baseline": 274.15, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "past the lighthouse and the market stalls fold open their striped awnings. Gulls wheel over "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1840, "end": 1931, "top": 276.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 530.4, "baseline": 288.1, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the quay while merchants argue cheerfully about the price of mackerel, and a baker carries "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 1931, "end": 2022, "top": 290.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 520.8, "baseline": 302.26, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "warm loaves across the cobbles to the cafe on the corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2022, "end": 2105, "top": 304.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 473.4, "baseline": 316.18, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the narrow streets fill with the sound of voices, bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2105, "end": 2173, "top": 318.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 537.0, "baseline": 331.3, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "TYPESETTING DEPENDS ON SMALL DECISIONS REPEATED THOUSANDS OF TIMES: "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2173, "end": 2238, "top": 333.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 522.0, "baseline": 346.42, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "WHERE A LINE ENDS, HOW MUCH SPACE FOLLOWS A PARAGRAPH, AND WHICH "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2238, "end": 2295, "top": 349.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 461.4, "baseline": 361.8, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "WORDS TRAVEL TOGETHER ACROSS A PAGE BOUNDARY. A FAITHFUL "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2295, "end": 2358, "top": 364.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 505.2, "baseline": 376.92, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "REPRODUCTION MUST MAKE EXACTLY THE SAME DECISIONS, BECAUSE ONE "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2358, "end": 2424, "top": 379.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 525.6, "baseline": 392.28, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "DIFFERENT BREAK EARLY IN A DOCUMENT MOVES EVERY LINE THAT FOLLOWS "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2424, "end": 2450, "top": 394.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 235.8, "baseline": 407.4, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "IT ONTO A DIFFERENT PAGE.\u000d"},
    {"page": 3, "start": 2450, "end": 2546, "top": 410.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 493.8, "baseline": 420.84, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "Mixed Case Words With Digits 2024 and a few punctuation marks, like these: (one) [two] \"three\".\u000d"},
